Author: Matthew Soulanille <msoulanille@google.com>
Date:   Tue Nov 16 11:01:11 2021 -0800

    [wasm] Fix memory leak in node when disposing wasm backend (#5852)
    
    Fixes #5851. This is caused by listeners to 'uncaughtException' and 'unhandledRejection' not being cleaned up when the wasm backend is disposed. See the related emscripten issue https://github.com/emscripten-core/emscripten/issues/12740 for more info.

